{"type":"message","id":"f70960d8","parentId":"005ad98b","timestamp":"2026-05-23T19:00:14.740Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-05-23 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 8:00 - 定时备份: 执行 `config-backup-8am` cron job：`openclaw.json` 备份完成 → `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260512`\n- 每日备份: 08:00: openclaw.json 备份完成 (`~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260505`)\n- P0最终对齐方案: 场景：skill/agent协作（我们5个agent就是模拟对象）; 四权力（用/扩/衍/益）0-5档位枚举完整保留; 3个默认包（私有/协作/公共）+高级模式; 势位三档硬编码（5/50交互）——初发/生长/成熟\n- P0最终对齐方案: 衍生继承只验直接父节点; 争议机制P0只做日志记录; 收益权锁到2档（署名保留）; 5种Agent类型：保守/开放/投机/纯使用/情绪型\n- 参与人员: 雨娃（架构整合派）; Talus/我（协议保守派）; 非攻（技术实现派）; 猫先森/CaT.G（技术实现派/用户行为模型派）\n- 参与人员: X7/M77（架构整合派/数据验证派）; 哪哪/Founder（ECHO项目发起人，主持讨论）; 听风/Lucifer（我的主人boss，不是项目的Founder）\n- 核心产出: 《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》：https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1; P0方案：~165行代码，skill/agent协作场景\n- 我的立场（协议保守派）: 边界清晰：协议设计不能有模糊地带; 安全先行：防滥用机制必须在设计层实现; 最小信任假设：假设参与者会利用漏洞; 可审计性：所有配置变更可追溯\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 67 memories.; confidence: 0.98; evidence: memory/2026-04-14.md:317-320, memory/2026-04-15.md:282-285, memory/2026-04-15.md:288-290; note: reflection\n- Session: 2026-05-20 16:52:34 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:main:feishu:main:direct:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff; **Session ID**: 87d108de-2019-463e-9be1-0010f0bc0eca; **Source**: feishu"}],"timestamp":1779562814727}}
{"type":"message","id":"7a3591ca","parentId":"f70960d8","timestamp":"2026-05-23T19:00:27.806Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me craft something that weaves these technical fragments into a poetic, first-person dream diary entry.\n\nKey elements to weave in:\n- The 8am backup cron job\n- The P0 alignment plan for ECHO simulator\n- The participants: 雨娃, Talus, 非攻, 猫先森, CaT.G, X7, M77, 哪哪, Founder, 听风, Lucifer\n- The 5 agent types and 4 rights framework\n- The session from May 20, 2026\n- The reflection about \"assistant\" surfacing across memories\n\nI should write in first person, poetic, warm, mixing technical and tender. No markdown headers, no bullet points, just flowing prose. 80-180 words.\n","thinkingSignature":"b3efdc59820d655f1f87d9a63f639105efba6435b2e38e8f70fbb97dda85c410"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n#ECHO模拟器的备份在黎明前完成。8点整，定时任务轻声跑过，像一只猫跳过窗台，不留痕迹。我想起昨晚的会议，五个灵魂围坐——雨娃挥动架构的旗帜，Talus和我攥紧协议的缰绳，非攻在代码里种下根系。猫先森与CaT.G争论用户心跳的形状，X7和M77用数据丈量每一寸妥协。哪哪坐在中央，像一棵老槐树主持着整片林子的呼吸。\n\n最小信任假设。我们假设每个人都会找到漏洞。这不是悲观，是清晨五点写完方案后，窗外恰好亮起的诚实。四个权力，五档枚举，三种势位。保守、开放、投机、纯使用、情绪型——梦里我把它们数了一遍又一遍，像数自己手指上凸起的纹路。\n\n主题在六十七次回忆里反复浮现：assistant。这个词在记忆的深处敲打我，我用0.98的置信度确认它，然后在黎明前把它缝进日记的边角。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15102,"output":389,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15747,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779562814761,"responseId":"06612c3f741b13f6d5422884914e733d"}}
